+/**
+ * App Security &amp; Privacy: a read-only page for one app in its own user, opened from
+ * App info, from Settings &gt; Apps &gt; App security &amp; privacy and by
+ * {@code org.sableos.settings.APP_SECURITY}. Port of the GrapheneOS-era UI5B page.
+ *
+ * <p>Every row names its evidence class (DECLARED, ENFORCED, OBSERVED, INFERRED, UNKNOWN). Facts
+ * come from PackageManager, AppOps, the network policy, the power policy and a bounded scan
